### Nieuw device aanmaken
POST {{host}}/devices
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "DEV-001",
  "locationCode": "Zaal A - Rij 3",
  "model": "TechnoGym Skillrun",
  "deviceType": 0,
  "installationYear": 2024,
  "isActive": true
}

### Alle devices ophalen
