### 1 device ophalen op id
GET {{host}}/devices/2

### Device bijwerken
PUT {{host}}/devices/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "serialNumber": "DEV-001",
  "locationCode": "Zaal B - Rij 1",
  "model": "TechnoGym Skillrun",
  "deviceType": 0,
  "installationYear": 2024,
  "isActive": false
}

