Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sessie aanvragen (Cardio-toestel = deviceType 0)
POST {{host}}/trainingsessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "deviceType": 0
}

### Eigen sessies ophalen
GET {{host}}/trainingsessions
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 1 sessie ophalen op id
GET {{host}}/trainingsessions/4
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sessie starten
PUT {{host}}/trainingsessions/4/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Sessie voltooien
PUT {{host}}/trainingsessions/4/complete
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "caloriesBurned": 250
}

### Foutieve overgang testen: nogmaals starten (moet 409 geven, sessie is al Completed)
PUT {{host}}/trainingsessions/1/start
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Support ticket aanmaken (als lid)
POST {{host}}/supporttickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "subject": "Loopband maakt raar geluid",
  "description": "Toestel DEV-001 maakt een piepend geluid tijdens gebruik.",
  "priority": 2
}

### Eigen tickets ophalen (als lid)
GET {{host}}/supporttickets/mine
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Alle tickets ophalen (admin, manage:tickets nodig)
GET {{host}}/supporttickets
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### Ticket-status wijzigen (admin, manage:tickets nodig)
PUT {{host}}/supporttickets/1/status
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "status": 1
}

