### GraphQL: sessies + toestel + telemetrie in 1 call
POST {{host}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { trainingSessions { id status device { serialNumber deviceType } telemetryReadings { powerWatts heartRate timestamp } } }"
}

### GraphQL: devices filteren + sorteren
POST {{host}}/graphql
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "query": "query { devices(where: { deviceType: { eq: CARDIO } }, order: { serialNumber: ASC }) { id serialNumber deviceType isActive } }"
}

